HELP_07_MIDI RCDATA "docs/help/07-midi-learn-clock.md"
HELP_08_LIGHTING RCDATA "docs/help/08-lighting-arm-blackout.md"
HELP_09_BENCH RCDATA "docs/help/09-benchmark.md"
